This is the directory of the matlab functions that I have
written or have gotten from other statistician.

There are "general" functions in this directory and special
functions in the following subdirectories.

ebbs - local bandwidth selection for local polynomial regression

lpoly - local polynomial regression

marron - from Steve Marron

ola - from Ola Hossjer

old - old files that I am not using but may need in the future

srs - smoothed (i.e., penalized) regression splines
